@testray.main.component.name = "Patcher Builder"
Feature: Patcher Builder and 71 fixpack
    Testing creation of 71 fixpack on Patcher Builder.
  
  Setup:
  	* I go to the Patcher Builder Jenkins homepage

  Scenario: Run fix pack builder fixpack 7x job
    @priority = "3"
    As a TSE, I should be able to run the fixpack-builder-fixpack-7x(uat) job

    Given I start the fixpack-builder-fixpack-7x uat job with the following parameters
      | fix.pack.fixed.issues | LPE-16341,LPE-16386,LPE-16459,LPE-16460,LPE-16461,LPE-16466,LPE-16469 |
      | fix.pack.id           | 25                                                                    |
      | git.revision          | acdd74a9994482610f7b5933cc1961b5808833fe                              |
    And I wait for "5" seconds
    And I go to the Patcher Builder Jenkins homepage
    And I get the current build number for the job titled "fixpack-builder-fixpack-7x-uat"
    And I check the job with the name "fixpack-builder-fixpack-7x-uat" and build number "${staticJobBuildNumber}" for completion
    And I go to the Patcher Builder Jenkins homepage
    Then the job with the name "fixpack-builder-fixpack-7x-uat" and build number "${staticJobBuildNumber}" should have been successful
